  "name": "Chilli Sauce",
  "text": "Chilli Sauce\n\nPreparation time: 15 minutes\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\n1-2 tbsp olive oil,\n\n1 large onion (finely chopped),\n\n2 cloves garlic (crushed),\n\n125 g rindless streaky bacon (chopped),\n\n1-2 fresh red or green chilies (chopped),\n\n400 g can of chopped tomatoes,\n\n50-75 g pecorino or Parmesan cheese (shaved),\n\nSalt & pepper,\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Heat the oil in a pan and cook the onion, garlic and bacon until lightly coloured.\n\n2. Add the chilies, tomatoes, and 25 g of the cheese. Cook over a gentle heat for 30-40 minutes until the sauce thickens. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n\n3. Server at once, sprinkled with the remaining cheese.",
  "prepTime": "PT15M",
